{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083300/extras/0e91094c52f16ae32c35c773b5921460.avif?t=1774070694\" width=1200 height=340 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Own your very own RAT FARM in this surreal horror farming experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BREED</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Breed your rats with one another, mix their genes and bask in your vermin spawn! Every rat and their children are entirely unique, bringing endless combinations to explore. Breed rats the old fashioned way, or splice genes in the laboratory and implant rat embryos into surrogates, anything to create the rat of your dreams. Your imagination is the limit for rodent experimentation!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083300/extras/181de4bdefd3fe26b88c586492b8e34a.poster.avif?t=1774070694\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083300/extras/181de4bdefd3fe26b88c586492b8e34a.webm?t=1774070694\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083300/extras/181de4bdefd3fe26b88c586492b8e34a.mp4?t=1774070694\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PROFIT</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every rat has its value, and every farmer needs cash! Watch their genes and selectively breed the most profitable rats to fund your farming venture. Every gene you strengthen is another dollar made, and every stat increased is more profit in your pocket.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083300/extras/fd11c3fb5f1b6ca4426aa368e0c168ab.poster.avif?t=1774070694\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083300/extras/fd11c3fb5f1b6ca4426aa368e0c168ab.webm?t=1774070694\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083300/extras/fd11c3fb5f1b6ca4426aa368e0c168ab.mp4?t=1774070694\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GROW</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow, water, and harvest various cheese plants to sustain your vermin ecosystem! Different cheeses can affect your rats very <i>DNA</i>, influencing how they breed and which genes will survive through their next of kin. Experiment with different cheeses and see what mutates into your gene pool!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083300/extras/ed2e31b9e939cd2e0fb6b3bfa94828fa.poster.avif?t=1774070694\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083300/extras/ed2e31b9e939cd2e0fb6b3bfa94828fa.webm?t=1774070694\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083300/extras/ed2e31b9e939cd2e0fb6b3bfa94828fa.mp4?t=1774070694\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > With several explorable areas holding a bounty of activities, you'll never run out of ways to expand your rat monopoly. Visit the town to upgrade your gear and enlist your rats in illicit competitions, or visit the sewers below to discover unique rats to breed into your gene pool. For a little R&amp;R, stop by the pond for a relaxing fishing trip, pulling up artifacts and aquatic rodentry. Rats can be found everywhere, but be careful which ones you take home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083300/extras/614179e9fa70b5df4e33d5406769263f.poster.avif?t=1774070694\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083300/extras/614179e9fa70b5df4e33d5406769263f.webm?t=1774070694\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083300/extras/614179e9fa70b5df4e33d5406769263f.mp4?t=1774070694\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILD</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your farm to fit your needs, build new pens, planters, and decorations to make your farm a home! Make this land your own with an expansive catalogue of items to give your rats the life of luxury they deserve, or automate your farm with rat-powered machinery for maximum profit output.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083300/extras/f2b310c0eb0835d984271990d9a62f5a.poster.avif?t=1774070694\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083300/extras/f2b310c0eb0835d984271990d9a62f5a.webm?t=1774070694\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083300/extras/f2b310c0eb0835d984271990d9a62f5a.mp4?t=1774070694\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>APPEASE</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <i><strong>RAT KING</strong></i> has big plans for you. Meet him in the caverns of the sewers, heed his demands of sacrifice, and be rewarded bountifully.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083300/extras/72e19cb5aa784e5c924f4e50f038175f.poster.avif?t=1774070694\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083300/extras/72e19cb5aa784e5c924f4e50f038175f.webm?t=1774070694\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083300/extras/72e19cb5aa784e5c924f4e50f038175f.mp4?t=1774070694\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4083300?t=1774070694","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083300/1b7dbe6a85dd27a7ee0fd00cd376e96688c84f99/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774070694","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083300/dfd21dcf872b1bb196a285ac1f4880b073bef9fc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774070694","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083300/dfd21dcf872b1bb196a285ac1f4880b073bef9fc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774070694","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"You can beat up creatures with a bat and eat rats when you're a VERY hungry fella."},"demos":[{"appid":4524330,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083300/extras/0e91094c52f16ae32c35c773b5921460.avif?t=1774070694\" width=1200 height=340 /></span></p><p class=\