tX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 83 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Itty bitty sound card</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Geforce GTX 970 Or Equivalent<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 83 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> BIG sound card</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["WyndonCorp"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Drogas l\u00edcitas\nLinguagem impr\u00f3pria\nViol\u00eancia","rating":"12","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"12","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Gewalt\nAlkohol / Tabak\nSchimpfw\u00f6rte","rating":"16","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"16","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"To be announced"},"required_age":0,"reviews":"\u201cgenetically engineering paralyzed rats through inbreeding\u201d<br />\r\n10/10 \u2013 my friend sprinkle<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u201ci love getting my hands dirty and my rats dirtier\u201d<br />\r\n9/10 \u2013 my friend idiocrasy<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u201ci like taking the googly eye rat and the antenna rat and boinking em\u201d<br />\r\n10/10 \u2013 my friend retrocat<br />\r\n","screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083300/8c5d5f15e088673cd2e82f92e2a84aab1f9652d9/ss_8c5d5f15e088673cd2e82f92e2a84aab1f9652d9.1920x1080.jpg?t=1774070694","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083300/8c5d5f15e088673cd2e82f92e2a84aab1f9652d9/ss_8c5d5f15e088673cd2e82f92e2a84aab1f9652d9.600x338.jpg?t=1774070694"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamsta